---
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts.mjs';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="cols container">
    <div>
      <p class="label mono">// 색인</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">홈</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog">기록</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">소개</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="label mono">// 구독</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS 피드</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">사이트맵</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      <p class="label mono">// 원칙</p>
      <p>흙을 존중하고, 숫자로 증명하고, 현장에서 확인한다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="wordmark" aria-hidden="true">{SITE_TITLE}</p>
  <div class="base mono container">
    <span>© {year} {SITE_TITLE}</span>
    <span>재배 중 · 데이터 수집 중</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 0;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-top: var(--line-thick) solid var(--ink);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .label {
    color: var(--chlorophyll);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }
  a {
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--chlorophyll);
  }
  .note p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 22em;
  }
  .wordmark {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 19vw;
    line-height: 0.78;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--chlorophyll);
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-align: center;
    transform: translateY(0.06em);
  }
  .base {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    border-top: var(--line) solid var(--chlorophyll);
    max-width: none;
  }
</style>
